{"id":"8f6aad59a20ce501","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PresSig.md","title":"PresSig","display":"PresSig","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PresSig","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PresSig"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论公理代码。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>。</p>\n<p>zero=0, succ=1, add=2, mul=3（适用时）；lt=0，Cong_m=m&gt;=2（Pres）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PresSig E F R f r)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ Num1 E)\n  (and\n    (@ Num3 F)\n    (and\n      (exists w\n        (exists one (exists s (and (@ Omega w) (and (@ Num1 one) (and (@ Single one s) (@ Diff w s R)))))))\n      (and\n        (@ FunDom f F)\n        (and\n          (exists z2321 (exists z2322 (and (@ Num0 z2321) (and (@ Num0 z2322) (@ App f z2321 z2322)))))\n          (and\n            (exists z2323 (exists z2324 (and (@ Num1 z2323) (and (@ Num1 z2324) (@ App f z2323 z2324)))))\n            (and\n              (exists z2325 (exists z2326 (and (@ Num2 z2325) (and (@ Num2 z2326) (@ App f z2325 z2326)))))\n              (and (@ FunDom r R) (forall c (implies (in c R) (exists two (and (@ Num2 two) (@ App r c two)))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"769ef3d3a316871f\" href=\"?note=769ef3d3a316871f\" title=\"ZFC_Diff\">Diff</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2fa14e4bd3447c97\" href=\"?note=2fa14e4bd3447c97\" title=\"ZFC_FunDom\">FunDom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6abf464803506304\" href=\"?note=6abf464803506304\" title=\"ZFC_Num1\">Num1</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" href=\"?note=36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" title=\"ZFC_Num2\">Num2</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"328ced6f64afa4d9\" href=\"?note=328ced6f64afa4d9\" title=\"ZFC_Num3\">Num3</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"bdbfd129fa484068\" href=\"?note=bdbfd129fa484068\" title=\"ZFC_Single\">Single</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PresSig E F R f r)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Diff|Diff]]；[[ZFC_FunDom|FunDom]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Num2|Num2]]；[[ZFC_Num3|Num3]]；[[ZFC_Omega|Omega]]；[[ZFC_S